'''Starkiller Base system''' was a [[star system]] that,<ref name="awakensnovel" /> during the [[Cold War|conflict]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]], the First Order moved<ref name="Pablo Hidalgo Mobile">{{Twitter|pablohidalgo|status/679446383925960704|[[Pablo Hidalgo]]|date=2015-12-22|quote=4. Yeah, it moves.|archivedate=20160220173428|nolive=1}}</ref> the [[Starkiller Base|mobilized]] [[planet]] [[Ilum]] to<ref name="awakensnovel" /> in the [[Unknown Regions]]<ref name="TFA VD" /> in order to use its [[star]] as a power source. The planet's [[superweapon]] directed the star's power into a [[thermal oscillator]] as a way of collecting the [[dark energy]] it needed to function, dimming the star's light until it was snuffed out completely. However, the [[Battle of Starkiller Base|destruction]] of Starkiller Base allowed the star's energy to expand, forming a [[Solo (star)|new star]] in the planet's place causing it to becoming a binary star system.<ref name="awakensnovel" />

